{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:302134c2cd366881","name":"Detonite Cord","source":{"id":"source:reference-302134c2cd366881","title":"Detonite Cord","revision":20857,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:39:35Z","sha256":"7ed484332650a9b80bc3c7b246de0b315a97308d30ee406d46324501b19231c1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20857","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Detonite%20Cord&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-302134c2cd366881","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Detonite Cord- a long, thin cable of explosive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Detonite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Detonite","referenceId":"reference:d86e6d3a145c0440"},"- is used mainly for mining and commercial demolition. Military sappers also commonly employ it is the field for specialized uses. Like regular ",{"tag":"a","children":["Detonite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Detonite","referenceId":"reference:d86e6d3a145c0440"},", Detonite Cord is very stable and requires a Timer or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Manual Trigger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Manual_Trigger","referenceId":"reference:3bac33a88449a688"}," for detonation.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Detonite Cord is sold in reels, each with enough explosive to extend 6 squares. Multiple reels of Detonite Cord can be spliced together for larger explosions. Designed for precise explosions, Detonite Cord causes negligible damage beyond its 1-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. Detonite Cord gives a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check to determine if the explosive ignores the DR of an object the Detonite Cord is attached to.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 4d6 (Energy)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Radius:"]}," 1-Square (",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"},")\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
